<abstract>
<gco:CharacterString>The demographic data  was retrieved from the the UNHCR refugee statistics and spans from 2013 to 2023. The data provides consistent breakdown for total male and female populations. However, the specific age group breakdown is only available for Germany.</gco:CharacterString>
</abstract>
<purpose>
<gco:CharacterString>The dataset contains demographic breakdown of Ukrainians in European countries with asylum status.</gco:CharacterString>
</purpose>
